sequenceDiagram
    participant NL as NL指令
    participant TD as TaskDecomposer
    participant RA as ResourceAllocator
    participant CG as CodeGenerator
    participant SIM as SimulationBackend
    participant RV as ResultValidator
    participant FL as FeedbackLoop
    participant EH as ExceptionHandler
    NL->>TD: decompose(instruction)
    TD->>RA: List DecomposedTask
    RA->>CG: Dict task_id, arm_id
    CG->>SIM: Python code 9 primitives
    SIM->>RV: ExecutionLog
    RV->>FL: ValidationResult
    FL->>FL: analyze_feedback()
    FL->>RA: update_config params
    FL->>CG: update_config params
    SIM->>EH: exception on failure
    EH->>SIM: RecoveryAction
